@startuml Sum_Ssfm_LinBusoff_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_LinBusoff_Handler"

**Interfaces Legend**
    //ri116 //: LNM_ERRH_LossCommBus<n>.
   //II150 //: BatteryVoltage 
   //II154 //: batteryvoltage_RecoveryTimer
   //II153 //: reset_RecoveryTimer
   //pi160 //: LNM_ERRH_LossCommBus_Dem_SetEvent()
   //II184 //: Sum_Ssfm_Errh_GetDTCsDisabled (Sum_Ssfm_DTCsDisabled)   
   
endlegend

note top of EC
On reception of notification from LNM, 
from port LNM_ERRH_LossCommBus<n> 
SSFM will set the DTC related to the Network <n>.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_LinBusoff_Handler] as EC{
    portin ri116
    portout pi160

	[Sum_Ssfm_LinBusoff_Handler]  as E
}

   interface II150
   interface II154
   interface II153
   interface II184


 
  II150 -> E
  ri116 -> E
  II154 -> E
  II153 -> E
  II184 -> E

  E -> pi160


@enduml
